          "id": "boo-at-the-zoo-2026-10-10",
          "title": "Boo at the Zoo",
          "description": "Philadelphia Zoo's Boo at the Zoo runs nine days across five weekends: October 10, 11, 12, 17, 18, 24, 25, 31, and November 1, from 9:30 AM to 5:00 PM each day. Trick-or-treating takes place throughout the Zoo, with costume contests at Impala Lawn at 11:30 a.m. and 2:30 p.m. daily, seasonal decorations, animal pumpkin feedings and enrichments, and children's activities. All candy stations participate in the Teal Pumpkin Project, offering allergy-friendly non-food treats. Included with general admission or membership.",
